OL,3,GNEWSABoy 'over the moon' to switch on
OL,4,AChristmas lights
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 11-year-old fundraiser said he was
OL,7,F"totally speechless" to discover he had
OL,8,Fbeen selected to switch on this year's
OL,9,FChristmas lights in Loughborough.
OL,11,FOver the summer, Freddie ran a mile
OL,12,Fevery day for 30 days and raised more
OL,13,Fthan #2,100 for Parkinson's UK and The
OL,14,FRoyal British Legion, in aid of his
OL,15,Fgreat grandfather.
OL,17,FHis family said Freddie "always looks
OL,18,Ffor ways to help others" and without
OL,19,Fhis knowledge nominated him for the
OL,20,FLight up Loughborough competition.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
