OL,3,GNEWSABoy 'over the moon' to switch on
OL,4,AChristmas lights
OL,5,
OL,6,FFreddie, from Shepshed, said he was
OL,7,Fsurprised and "over the moon" to have
OL,8,Fthe honour of switching on the festive
OL,9,Flights in the Market Place on 27
OL,10,FNovember.
